{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in the adventures of an Eastern European post-apocalypse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vagrant</strong> is an ordinary man who has long felt like a <strong>nobody</strong> in this <strong>cruel</strong> world. But after being robbed yet again, he decides to <strong>leave</strong> this land once and for all. A <strong>dynamic</strong> story gradually unfolds around an ordinary man who wants to gain true <strong>freedom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This is a visual novel with quest elements where you can choose different options for your actions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/extras/588da4fbe7c59271e535f7f5c3641d13.poster.avif?t=1760782426\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/extras/588da4fbe7c59271e535f7f5c3641d13.webm?t=1760782426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/extras/588da4fbe7c59271e535f7f5c3641d13.mp4?t=1760782426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>head and heart</strong> to make <strong>decisions</strong> that seem \u201cright\u201d at first glance, even though it is unclear whether there are any \u201cright\u201d options here. Along the <strong>way,</strong> you will often be faced with rather ambiguous choices, so you will need to rely on your inner <strong>feelings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A system of dynamic thoughts has been implemented.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/extras/7bc2834b7b9e33b87878250966863fe4.poster.avif?t=1760782426\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/extras/7bc2834b7b9e33b87878250966863fe4.webm?t=1760782426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/extras/7bc2834b7b9e33b87878250966863fe4.mp4?t=1760782426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't mindlessly click <strong>\u201cnext\u201d</strong>\u00a0your character is alive and has their own lines, thoughts, and a second voice inside their head. The story is told from the first person; you don't watch them, you are them.  <strong>And also...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several endings in the game, <strong>four</strong> to be exact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character is <strong>unique,</strong> not a carbon copy, and there are a lot of them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vagrant is an <strong>ordinary person</strong>, not a hero. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various <strong>dangers.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of different <strong>achievements</strong> that must be obtained for certain actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you get through the <strong>Zone</strong> and reach the western border?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/extras/811d48c4f43711c16c0cfeba46214803.avif?t=1760782426\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">Although first you have to <strong>get there...</strong> </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969280?t=1760782426","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/4df1128521fcd409d97f80750ec48242c13b293a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760782426","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/d5fe5bb4089558757bb61ddf586e2f92a34f1aec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760782426","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/d5fe5bb4089558757bb61ddf586e2f92a34f1aec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760782426","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in the adventures of an Eastern European post-apocalypse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vagrant</strong> is an ordinary man who has long felt like a <strong>nobody</strong> in this <strong>cruel</strong> world. But after being robbed yet again, he decides to <strong>leave</strong> this land once and for all. A <strong>dynamic</strong> story gradually unfolds around an ordinary man who wants to gain true <strong>freedom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This is a visual novel with quest elements where you can choose different options for your actions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/extras/588da4fbe7c59271e535f7f5c3641d13.poster.avif?t=1760782426\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/extras/588da4fbe7c59271e535f7f5c3641d13.webm?t=1760782426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source sr