i><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various <strong>dangers.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of different <strong>achievements</strong> that must be obtained for certain actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you get through the <strong>Zone</strong> and reach the western border?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/extras/811d48c4f43711c16c0cfeba46214803.avif?t=1760782426\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">Although first you have to <strong>get there...</strong> </p></li></ul>","developers":["DIRECTOR`S CUT"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969280/48f4bbe15f5ad1db4ad93de645b6aae99f66ecfb/header.jpg?t=1760782426","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3969280/555853722/bdfcc4352e5b29c478856974c560fc594e7736ec/1760701851/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760703194","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3969280/555853722/bdfcc4352e5b29c478856974c560fc594e7736ec/1760701851/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760703194","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3969280/555853722/bdfcc4352e5b29c478856974c560fc594e7736ec/1760701851/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760703194","id":257219204,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219204/movie480.mp4?t=1760703194","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.co